# DashSpec Studio — vision alignment
# STUDIO-ADR-0002 report-author (full deck sketch)

use aiguiders-mental-model

vision dashspec-studio
  title "DashSpec Studio — report author"

screen studio
  preset report-author
  topology (MFD)(F)
  forward report-preview
  mfd-tabs Project | Layout | Pad
  mfd spec-tree | editor
  split data-lab
  eicas resolve

  tree spec-tree
  tabs editor
  preview report-preview
  repl data-lab
  pad script-pad
  panel layout-board
  panel resolve

screen command-palette overlay
  search
  command-list

go studio -> command-palette when Ctrl+K
go command-palette -> studio when Escape
go command-palette -> studio when select-command
  then focus editor open selected file

on spec-tree double-click file -> editor
  then open tab and show resolve

fixture spec-tree
  📁 planet-repo/
  ├─ report.dashspec
  ├─ libraries/
  ├─ layouts/
  ├─ diagrams/peak-kpi.dashdiagram
  └─ sql/migrations/

fixture command-list
  Save active document
  Open demo_soak
  Open demo_analytics
  Focus preview
  Reload resolve

fixture data-lab
  connector: demo-db · OK
  schema: reports / cards / binds
  repl: SELECT federation_status()

fixture script-pad
  > create report with sql-server template ulsa-weekly
  Plan: report.dashspec · filters.dashlibrary · catalog.gdl · 001_views.sql

end
